feat(engine): add Gumbel-AlphaZero root selection

Replaces PUCT root selection with Gumbel top-k sampling and sequential
halving. Measurably reduces the number of simulations needed to reach
equivalent policy quality at 400–800 sims (Danihelka et al., ICLR 2022).

Gated behind MCTS(use_gumbel=True); default remains PUCT until SPRT
confirms improvement.
